# Steelbore Standard §6.5 — Text File Format.
#
# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository and on checkout, regardless
# of the contributor's core.autocrlf setting (which defaults to true on Windows
# and rewrites the working tree). A CRLF exception, if one is ever needed, is
# pinned here as its own line (e.g. `*.bat text eol=crlf`), never left implicit.
* text=auto eol=lf
